      * WORKSTN display file, externally described (FREE-43, RV-12, RV-31)
     H
     FDSPFILE CF  E                    WORKSTN
     F                                        RRN   KSFILE SFLREC
     F                                               ID    DEVNAM
     F                                               SAVDS DEVDS
     F                                               NUM        2
     C                     Z-ADD1         RRN   40
     C                     WRITESFLREC
     C                     EXFMTCTLREC                 90
     C                     READCSFLREC                   91
     C           RRN       CHAINSFLREC               92
     C                     UPDATSFLREC
     C                     CLOSEDSPFILE
     C                     ACQ  DSPFILE
      * FREE-71: program device in factor 1; the ACQ above has none (R)
     C           'DEV1'    ACQ  DSPFILE                93
     C           'DEV1'    NEXT DSPFILE
     C                     POST DSPFILE
     C           'DEV1'    REL  DSPFILE
